[{"title":"铁壁","author":"释心月","text":"天地为炉烹不破，不通风处却通风。\n自从透得归来后，方见一重还一重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7123,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十一首 其十","author":"释心月","text":"也大奇，也大奇，卷舒出没看全机。\n若非鉴物张华眼，未免随人说是非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7124,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十一首 其七","author":"释心月","text":"宗门中令嗣，合眼坐禅处。\n平地打毬子，急须著眼觑。\n两挑挑得上，三筑筑不住。\n筑得住依前，辊向毬门去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7125,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十一首 其五","author":"释心月","text":"普济把定，被庞公痛处一锥。\n直得左转右侧，前依后随。\n笊篱提起处，相呼作舞时。\n若言依样画猫儿，定把黄金铸子期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7126,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十一首 其四","author":"释心月","text":"第一句，言不及。\n见利忘锥，何得何失。\n拈起放下，翘足而立。\n文殊维摩，鎗箭交击。\n果不可当，一掌推出。\n纵是舜若多神，额头也须汗出。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7127,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十一首 其三","author":"释心月","text":"昨日与今日，同中却不同。\n狞龙搅沧海，俊鹘摩青空。\n宗眼明如日，机轮疾似风。\n丹霞回首处，遍界觅无踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7128,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十一首 其二","author":"释心月","text":"各呈见解，互逞机锋。\n石火莫及，电光罔通。\n抛下拄杖而立，不同草草。\n拈起拄杖便行，亦岂匆匆。\n者里著得只眼，许你亲见庞公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7129,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古二十一首 其一","author":"释心月","text":"兄难兄，弟难弟。\n马祖真，只这是。\n撼动西江十八滩，水面无风波自起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7130,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十二","author":"释心月","text":"杨岐谈笑之中，换了白云心肝五脏。\n而白云愤闷之际，抉了杨岐鼻孔眼睛。\n若在今时亦未可，祸不入谨家之门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7131,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十一","author":"释心月","text":"天寒人寒，影草探竿。\n总在里许，振鬣摆尾，水面依然平似砥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7132,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其十","author":"释心月","text":"朝西天，暮东土。\n玩水游山，徐行款步。\n是则不动道场，不是亦在里许。\n谁为證明，石霜角虎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7133,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其七","author":"释心月","text":"宾中主，主中宾。\n在窟狮子，互换嚬呻，相识如今能几人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7134,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十六首 其三","author":"释心月","text":"恁么说话，大似肥处添，瘦处减。\n殊不知东山老人，惯得其便。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7135,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古三首 其三","author":"释心月","text":"没便宜处讨便宜，无位真人小厮儿。\n如是去来如是住，无时不是在家时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7136,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一三四","author":"释心月","text":"与么来者，过者边立。\n不与么来者，过者边立。\n与么不与么，花须连夜发，莫待晓风吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7137,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一五一","author":"释心月","text":"云漫漫，水漫漫。\n往来一致，高下同观。\n炊无米饭，饱不来入甚易。\n吃粥了也，洗钵盂去还难。\n难难，冬不寒，腊后看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7138,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一四九","author":"释心月","text":"五髻峰头望海东，烟重重又水重重。\n同人相见论心事，又得西来一信通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7139,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一四八","author":"释心月","text":"溪山送别出门日，云水相迎得路时。\n七佛轨仪持钵去，满船载得月明归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7140,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一四七","author":"释心月","text":"然灯之前，六六三十六。\n然灯之后，九九八十一。\n数目甚分明，因甚数不出。\n数得出，弄到弥勒下生，依旧杳无消息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7141,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一四六","author":"释心月","text":"涅槃心，差别智。\n一非一，二非二。\n自古诸上贤，曾未达斯理。\n直饶恁么会得，也是乌龟行陆地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7142,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一四二","author":"释心月","text":"清净慈门刹尘数，共生如来一妙相。\n以大愿力出世间，示梵王身宣正法。\n三十六旬有六日，惟有此日最吉祥。\n稽首慇勤一瓣香，万岁千秋为寿考。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7143,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一三九","author":"释心月","text":"空手把锄头，步行骑水牛。\n人从桥上过，桥流水不流，动地清风来未休。\n咄，下座佛殿，别听因由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7144,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一三八","author":"释心月","text":"十月十有五，败叶堆云，寒风推户。\n明窗下，东司头。\n东行西行，总是提持处。\n参玄人，须记取。\n古人有言兮，百岁光阴切莫虚度。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7145,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一三六","author":"释心月","text":"八月初一，好个消息。\n积雨报初晴，新凉生八极。\n禾稻满田畴，催人早收拾。\n一颗颗，一粒粒。\n宜爱惜，莫教遍地成狼籍。\n直待去年今年，官租私租，一时还毕。\n不妨一饱忘百饥，鼓腹讴歌度残日。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7146,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一三五","author":"释心月","text":"我有一语，在在处处。\n提起分开，放下捏聚。\n两手持来，一手分付。\n江西曾有言，以此个为主。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7147,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一三三","author":"释心月","text":"一非一，二非二。\n仰面不见天，低头不见地。\n一即一，二即二。\n仰面见青天，低头亦见地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7148,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一三一","author":"释心月","text":"闰二月十有五，灵山有语今分付。\n心洞十方，通今贯古。\n途路未归人，朝朝复暮暮。\n不醉桃花村，定入杏花坞。\n何如相唤复相呼，飞来峰下吃茶去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7149,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一三○","author":"释心月","text":"春山青，春水绿，独立危亭看不足。\n李花白，桃花红，一色同中又不同。\n知音惟有寒山子，拊掌歌笑临春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7150,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一二九","author":"释心月","text":"峭峻门庭，平白道路。\n担板睦州，面壁鲁祖。\n不问南来北来，东去西去，须信长年不出户。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7151,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一二七","author":"释心月","text":"云门一曲，腊月二十五。\n惊起陕府铁牛，撞倒石霜角虎。\n时节既相当，因缘难莽卤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7152,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一二六","author":"释心月","text":"山苍苍，水茫茫。\n直下是，非相当。\n整三玄戈甲，淬三要锋铓。\n举意非他物，回眸即故乡。\n好将马祖旧游地，题作渝州选佛场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7153,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一二五","author":"释心月","text":"作么生，是什么。\n狮子当门，猛虎据坐。\n千人万人，一个半个。\n石火电光中，掣断黄金锁，拟议依然还蹉过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7154,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一二二","author":"释心月","text":"大仙心，休莽卤。\n三十三，错分付。\n细推穷在何处，只知昨日雨今日晴，而不知今日晴昨日雨。\n灵云陌上桃花飞，翻忆玄沙未彻语。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7155,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一二一","author":"释心月","text":"未见此老人已前，上是天下是地。\n既见此老人之后，山是山水是水。\n一别五十年，恩怨通身是。\n没量大人，抬脚不起，累了儿兮累了孙，恼乱春风何日已。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7156,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一二○","author":"释心月","text":"眼中物，物中眼。\n雪峰辊三个毯，睦州担一片板。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7157,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一一八","author":"释心月","text":"巴陵三转语，南源女人拜。\n人贫智短，马瘦毛长，灵鹫峰头一炷香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7158,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一一七","author":"释心月","text":"簇簇上来，却之不回。\n簇簇下去，留之不住。\n于斯立片时，瞬目不扬眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7159,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一一四","author":"释心月","text":"髻中珠，只者是。\n如优昙花，时一现尔。\n坐断意根，方能侧耳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7160,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一一三","author":"释心月","text":"外息诸缘，心行无路。\n入得无门之门，犹较昔日三步。\n灵踪不在猿啼处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7161,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一一○","author":"释心月","text":"虎丘家风，内空外空。\n十分富贵，十分贫穷。\n有时扬声止响，有时诈哑佯聋，犹是平常小脱空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7162,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一○九","author":"释心月","text":"药山休去，直得三十二相八十种好，一时现前。\n然虽如是，也好与一杓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7163,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一○八","author":"释心月","text":"初五初十，铁蛇钻不入。\n有也莫将去，无也莫将来。\n南岳自南岳，天台自天台，那更峨嵋对五台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7164,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一○七","author":"释心月","text":"最初机，末后句。\n有准绳，没规矩。\n岂可错承当，岂可错分付。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7165,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一○六","author":"释心月","text":"五九四十五，太阳开门户。\n一点微云何处来，散作人间三日雨。\n晓来忽推窗，所见非常处。\n白玉作楼台，烂银为国土。\n盐官王老师，欢喜无著处。\n拈起须弥槌，击动虚空鼓。\n清音闻远近，雅韵贯今古。\n法眼和一通，听之犹莽卤。\n古人有言兮，千年田，八百主。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7166,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一○五","author":"释心月","text":"座已升，衣已披，法作么生说。\n但得雪消去，自然春到来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7167,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一○四","author":"释心月","text":"诸佛机，祖师意。\n百草头，双眉底。\n不可得而一，不可得而二。\n赵州关即且置，云门曲作么生。\n一堂风冷淡，千古意分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7168,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一○三","author":"释心月","text":"有句无句，如藤倚树。\n树倒藤枯，毒蛇横路。\n咄咄咄，缩头去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7169,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其一○二","author":"释心月","text":"初三十一，上上大吉。\n中九下七，有口挂壁。\n双林傅大士儒履道冠，蒋山梁宝公剪刀曲尺，笑倒生公台畔石。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7170,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其九十九","author":"释心月","text":"知之而行，见之而止，对面白云千万里。\n言中定旨，语外明宗，一重一重复一重。\n斯门寂寂无关锁，清坐不知谁与同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7171,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其九十七","author":"释心月","text":"二千年前，灵山付嘱品。\n二千年后，吴地流通分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7172,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其九十六","author":"释心月","text":"与么也在我，不与么也在我。\n明眼汉担拄杖绕天下横行，为什么透这些子不得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7173,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其九十三","author":"释心月","text":"一句子，有时坐断乾坤笼罩今古，有时风高月冷海晏河清，有时变化晦明兴云致雨。\n今日总抛向面前，切不得世谛流布。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7174,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其九十二","author":"释心月","text":"平怀常实事同风，正在昏昏梦寐中。\n扶起脊梁重猛省，莫教蹉过五更钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7175,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其八十九","author":"释心月","text":"直上觑，直下觑。\n七佛已前，闲家泼具。\n少室铁牛，黄梅石女。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7176,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其八十八","author":"释心月","text":"我佛入深山，六载冷相守。\n中夜一举头，南辰对北斗。\n于此眼皮穿，一场成漏逗。\n普观大地人，此事皆具有。\n至今二千年，公案宛如旧。\n不见赵州曾有言，修行变作不唧衔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7177,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其八十四","author":"释心月","text":"三种病二种光即不问，且如何是法身。\n不识庐山真面目，只缘身在此山中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7178,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其八十二","author":"释心月","text":"四月十五，云龙风虎。\n扫荡欃枪，肃清寰宇。\n五月十五，松峦竹坞。\n明月作龛，白云闭户。\n即今六月十五，毒蛇横古路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7179,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其八十一","author":"释心月","text":"犀牛扇子破多时，全暗全明。\n问著元来总不知，最为亲切。\n无限清风与头角，成群作队。\n尽同云雨去难追，鼻绳在我手里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7180,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其八十","author":"释心月","text":"久晴不雨则旱，旱固可忧。\n久雨不晴则涝，涝亦可忧。\n不旱不涝，尤为可忧。\n不曾下得春时种，空向田头望有秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7181,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其七十九","author":"释心月","text":"大厦非一木可支，巨舟须众手可济。\n众手既集亦复同心，南北东西无往不利。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7182,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其七十八","author":"释心月","text":"说时默，默时说。\n处处投机，门门合辙，正是虚空里钉橛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7183,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其七十六","author":"释心月","text":"十一十二，无处回避。\n十四十五，充塞寰宇。\n者边那边，或去或住。\n一箭上红心，黄金如粪土。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7184,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其七十四","author":"释心月","text":"七佛已前只与么，七佛之后亦复然。\n片云生晚谷，孤鹤下辽天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7185,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其七十二","author":"释心月","text":"钟阜龙盘，石城虎踞。\n牛首横前，方山傍住。\n正传阁上一观，不觉双眉陡聚，秦淮一带西流去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7186,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其七十一","author":"释心月","text":"道远乎哉，触事而真。\n圣远乎哉，体之即神。\n百丈遭喝，三日耳聋。\n水潦被踏，起来大笑。\n何似一指头禅，一生受用不尽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7187,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其七十","author":"释心月","text":"檐头滴滴，分明历历。\n好片祖师心，无端已狼籍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7188,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其六十九","author":"释心月","text":"是不是，非不非。\n交肩过，携手归。\n南泉不出方丈，为什么在庄吃油糍。\n今兮昔兮同一时，知音知后更谁知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7189,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其六十七","author":"释心月","text":"罗笼得住，以此却不住。\n呼唤不回，以此却又回。\n且誵讹在什么处，恼乱春风卒未休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7190,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其六十六","author":"释心月","text":"结夏解夏，灵山旧制。\n鹅以瓶拘，鱼以网系。\n风雷变化在今时，霄汉振飞何更拟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7191,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其六十五","author":"释心月","text":"德山一棒，临济一喝。\n家贫难办素，事忙不及草。\n三千里外见誵讹，未免虾跳不出斗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7192,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百五十首 其六十三","author":"释心月","text":"笑密庵巧，喜松源拙，扫临济喝，折德山棒。\n自谓不蹑前脩，又道抛三放两。\n自谓无法与人，又道开口不在舌头上。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":7193,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]